@* The strip at the landing's foot (F118): the framework's SiteStrip with this site's words, configured (ADR 0125). It
   asks the agent to take the visitor's details, or leads to the contact page; a quote is on request (FX163). *@
<SiteStrip Heading="Want one for your business?">
    <Action>
        <AskButton Text="Leave your details" Question="I would like a website with an agent for my business. Please take my details so I can get a quote." />
        <LinkButton Href="/contact" Text="Contact us" Kind="ButtonKind.Quiet" />
    </Action>
    <ChildContent>Ask the agent in the corner to take your details, or write to us. Every quote is made for your business, on request.</ChildContent>
</SiteStrip>
